sequenceDiagram
    participant CS as Charging Station (Test System)
    participant CSMS as CSMS (System under Test)

    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: CSMS supports prepaid cards
    Note over CS,CSMS: Prerequisite: Prepaid card with an amount of "0" is available

    CS->>CSMS: AuthorizeRequest (idToken.idToken = <prepaid card no credit id>, idToken.type = <prepaid card no credit id type>)
    CSMS-->>CS: AuthorizeResponse (idTokenInfo.status = NoCredit)
    Note over CSMS: Validation: idTokenInfo.status must be NoCredit<br>idTokenInfo.cacheExpiryDateTime must be <current date/time>
